{"id":26526,"date":"2020-03-12T17:55:37","date_gmt":"2020-03-12T17:55:37","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/mobilunity.com\/?p=26526"},"modified":"2024-01-24T13:19:25","modified_gmt":"2024-01-24T13:19:25","slug":"mobilunity-was-recognized-by-top-digital-agency","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/mobilunity.com\/blog\/mobilunity-was-recognized-by-top-digital-agency\/","title":{"rendered":"Mobilunity Was Recognized by Top Digital Agency"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Mobilunity has been recognized by <a href=\"https:\/\/topdigital.agency\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow noreferrer\" data-wpel-link=\"external\">Top Digital Agency<\/a> and it&#8217;s our fourth award in a row this year. We are delighted to share this news with the World Tech Community again.<\/p>\n<p><span class=\"hidden-xs\">Go ahead and check out the badge from TDA below!<\/span><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/mobilunity.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/TDA-White-Badge.png\" alt=\"Top Digital Agency Badge\" class=\"hidden-xs aligncenter wp-image-26532 size-full\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\" title=\"Top Digital Agency Badge\"><\/p>\n<p>Top Digital Agency is an unbiased platform with online marketing agencies ratings, technology expertise and other achievements. One feature which stands out this listing from others is that they share agencies&#8217; real cases.<\/p>\n<p>Learn more about Mobilunity qualification, clients &amp; services via the following <a href=\"https:\/\/topdigital.agency\/agency\/mobilunity\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow noreferrer\" data-wpel-link=\"external\">link<\/a>. You may also find some of our case studies and articles covering the most common nearshoring model questions there.<\/p>\n<p>Read a <a href=\"https:\/\/topdigital.agency\/case-study\/winterfriend-ios-app-development\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow noreferrer\" data-wpel-link=\"external\">WinterFriend iOS App Development<\/a> case study to see how far our development and UI\/UX teams can go to provide an exceptional user experience.<\/p>\n<p>Mobilunity is thankful for the Top Digital Agency&#8217;s recognition and counts on visiting their office in Zagreb, Croatia one day. Watch the news from Mobilunity to stay on top!<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Mobilunity has been recognized by Top Digital Agency and it&#8217;s our fourth award in a row this year. We are delighted to share this news with the World Tech Community&#8230;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":3,"featured_media":40696,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"inline_featured_image":false,"_uag_custom_page_level_css":"","footnotes":""},"categories":[21,2877],"tags":[],"ppma_author":[8143],"class_list":["post-26526","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-blog","category-recognition"],"aioseo_notices":[],"uagb_featured_image_src":{"full":["https:\/\/mobilunity.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/tda-recognition-1200x628-1.png",1200,628,false],"thumbnail":["https:\/\/mobilunity.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/tda-recognition-1200x628-1-150x150.png",150,150,true],"medium":["https:\/\/mobilunity.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/tda-recognition-1200x628-1-300x157.png",300,157,true],"medium_large":["https:\/\/mobilunity.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/tda-recognition-1200x628-1-768x402.png",768,402,true],"large":["https:\/\/mobilunity.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/tda-recognition-1200x628-1-1024x536.png",1024,536,true],"1536x1536":["https:\/\/mobilunity.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/tda-recognition-1200x628-1.png",1200,628,false],"2048x2048":["https:\/\/mobilunity.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/tda-recognition-1200x628-1.png",1200,628,false],"portfolio_thumb":["https:\/\/mobilunity.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/tda-recognition-1200x628-1-500x262.png",500,262,true],"portfo